    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_honooboss_02",
      "hash64": "2B3424FF78D42095",
      "text": "Ho fatto evolvere un po’ di Charcadet.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_honooboss_03",
      "hash64": "2B3423FF78D41EE2",
      "text": "Adesso dovremmo avere abbastanza energia\\nper far muovere la Starmobile.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_dokuboss_01",
      "hash64": "8CB3ED175179BD66",
      "text": "Un’opera davvero encomiabile.\\nNon sei d’accordo, prode Ortiz?[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_fairyboss_01",
      "hash64": "553BCCF0C90A095A",
      "text": "Umpf! Ero convinto che fossi tutta chiacchiere\\ne niente fatti, e invece...[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_honooboss_04",
      "hash64": "2B341EFF78D41663",
      "text": "Oh, ma piantala con questo tuo modo di fare!\\nÈ insopportabile![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_fairyboss_02",
      "hash64": "553BCBF0C90A07A7",
      "text": "Vale lo stesso per te, Pruna![VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_fairyboss_03",
      "hash64": "553BCAF0C90A05F4",
      "text": "Ti fai sempre notare per via del tuo modo\\ndi rispondere e del tuo caratteraccio, no?[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_kakutouboss_02",
      "hash64": "A93E3FF7A9667950",
      "text": "Macché, Ortiz![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_kakutouboss_03",
      "hash64": "A93E40F7A9667B03",
      "text": "Le ragazze dell’accademia la bullizzano perché\\nsono invidiose della sua bellezza.\\c\\nLe sue rispostacce e il suo caratterino sono una\\nforma di autodifesa per evitare di farsi prendere\\r\\ndi mira, ecco tutto.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 183,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 207,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_kakutouboss_04",
      "hash64": "A93E45F7A9668382",
      "text": "Quindi... è per quello che poi dà nell’occhio.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_honooboss_05",
      "hash64": "2B341DFF78D414B0",
      "text": "Ma basta, Nespera, eddai! A chi interessa sapere\\nla mia vita, morte e miracoli?![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_akuboss_01",
      "hash64": "5091DFE52308FB9C",
      "text": "Diamoci un taglio, ok? È arrivato il momento\\ncruciale.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_kakutouboss_06",
      "hash64": "A93E43F7A966801C",
      "text": "Ci siamo quasi... L’Operazione Star sta per\\niniziare.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_dokuboss_02",
      "hash64": "8CB3EC175179BBB3",
      "text": "E l’Arcicapo? Di che avviso è?[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_akuboss_02",
      "hash64": "5091E2E5230900B5",
      "text": "Ha già contattato tutti i bulli dicendogli di\\nriunirsi al campo sportivo.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_honooboss_06",
      "hash64": "2B3420FF78D419C9",
      "text": "È finalmente arrivato il giorno... Non vedo l’ora...\\nSento un fuoco dentro...![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_honooboss_07",
      "hash64": "2B341FFF78D41816",
      "text": "Il mio fuoco interiore ha bruciato intensamente...\\nE adesso si è spento.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_honoo_040_honooboss_08",
      "hash64": "2B342AFF78D42AC7",
      "text": "È arrivata la fine per me.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
